Certificate-Flow-Film — licence summary
=======================================

This repository is dual-licensed by content type. Full texts are in LICENSES/.

1. SOURCE CODE — GPL-3.0-or-later (SPDX: GPL-3.0-or-later)
   Everything that is code: cff/, blender/, tools/, tests/, scripts/, site/
   scripts and build files. Blender-side scripts import `bpy`, which is
   GPL-licensed, so the project code is GPL-3.0-or-later to avoid any
   ambiguity. Full text: LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt

2. RENDERED FILM, IMAGES AND DOCUMENTATION — CC BY 4.0 (SPDX: CC-BY-4.0)
   The rendered film (MP4), posters, frames, contact sheets, and the
   written documentation in docs/ and README.md.
   Full text: LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt
   Attribution: "Certificate-Flow-Film" by SimSI2027, CC BY 4.0.

3. BUNDLED FONT — SIL Open Font License 1.1
   assets/fonts/Inter-*.ttf (Inter, (c) 2016 The Inter Project Authors,
   https://github.com/rsms/inter, release v4.1). Licence text:
   assets/fonts/OFL.txt. The font keeps its own licence.

4. USER CHARACTER — CC0 1.0 (SPDX: CC0-1.0)
   assets/character.blend: the MakeHuman base mesh, default rig weights,
   eyes, eyebrows, hair, clothes and shoes, all released as CC0 by the
   MakeHuman project (September 2020). Generated with the MPFB add-on
   (GPL-3.0-or-later, used only as a tool; none of its code is included).
   Sources, hashes and per-file licence statements:
   assets/character.manifest.json. Full text: LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt
